      "statement": "The eval folder layout separates data-building from execution: seed_corpus/ holds the manifest and labels; generators/ produces dataset candidates; adversarial/ defines the injection taxonomy; evaluators/ holds one module per PRD §10.1 evaluator with Qwen rubric prompts in rubrics/; targets.py adapts examples to agent calls; thresholds.yaml declares all release-gate targets; run.py is the entry point.",
