    {
      "id": "claim_d10a40aaf96d40889c76fa78172ae648",
      "statement": "The seed corpus is a fixed set of openly licensed documents (e.g. arXiv papers across 3–4 overlapping subjects, chains of citing papers, preprint/published pairs with the same work_key). PDFs are not committed; a download step fetches them to data/seed_corpus/ and verifies SHA-256. Only CC-BY-compatible licensed documents may be added.",
