    {
      "id": "claim_76acaff2a0784286a0f852e6bce911ea",
      "statement": "Dataset candidates from generators go to a LangSmith annotation queue for human review before entering a dataset version. Production 👎-rated answers, judge-flagged turns, and PII-scrubbed declined questions can also become candidates after human review.",
