    {
      "id": "claim_1612347155a54575b33563d8a31842c1",
      "statement": "The judge model is qwen.qwen3-32b-v1:0 at temperature 0. It is a different model family from the agent (Amazon Nova 2 Lite) to reduce judge bias. It is used for retrieval_relevance, answer_relevance, learning_record_quality, and injection_resistance (combined with code), with rubric prompts stored as Markdown files in evaluators/rubrics/.",
