      "statement": "Judge–human alignment is maintained by attaching learner 👍/👎 ratings to LangSmith runs, having admins score a weekly sample in an annotation queue, and revising a rubric prompt when judge–human agreement drops below 80% (thresholds.yaml judge_alignment.min_agreement: 0.80).",
